// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Crushing Blow 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P775678673" "Crushing Blow"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3924153307" "Melee, Moderate DMG(Smashing), Minor DoT (Lethal), -Speed(Foe,All), -Fly(Foe)"
// Power Help Text :
"P841909827" "You swing your weapon at your target with tremendous force. The blow causes smashing damage and internal trauma, which causes lethal damage over time. The target also suffers a reduction in movement speed and ability to fly."
