// Power Help Text :
"P3004588675" "You spin your staff like a propeller in front of you  dealing Light Smashing damage to enemies in your frontal arc and deflecting any incoming attacks, thus boosting your Melee and Lethal damage briefly.   While a form is active, this power will build one level of Perfection.  Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"
